{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Four Unique Fishing Boats Await</h2>Step aboard four distinctive fishing vessels: Arc, Sea Hunter, Mono-brew, and Richi-Kali. Each boat offers its own structure, secrets, and opportunities to be discovered.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/extras/ff2e09cf9cf9ad4a95824b41bd60f252.poster.avif?t=1752238964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/extras/ff2e09cf9cf9ad4a95824b41bd60f252.webm?t=1752238964\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/extras/ff2e09cf9cf9ad4a95824b41bd60f252.mp4?t=1752238964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Challenge - Fish on the Boat!</h2>The Fishing Boats DLC introduces a new obstacle - lingering fish left behind in the holds. Clear out those fish before you can fully break down the ships, adding a fresh twist to your demolition adventure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/extras/cde6df02386bf02f1cfe0cc0a25fa462.poster.avif?t=1752238964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/extras/cde6df02386bf02f1cfe0cc0a25fa462.webm?t=1752238964\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/extras/cde6df02386bf02f1cfe0cc0a25fa462.mp4?t=1752238964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fresh Fishing-Themed Loot</h2>Find and collect a variety of new items related to the fishing industry, including fishing rods, ice boxes, fishing nets, crab cages, and much more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/extras/be8ece1dc65882a82257079a4208a72c.poster.avif?t=1752238964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/extras/be8ece1dc65882a82257079a4208a72c.webm?t=1752238964\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/extras/be8ece1dc65882a82257079a4208a72c.mp4?t=1752238964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Contracts, Collectibles, and Achievements</h2>Take on new contracts, hunt for hidden collectibles, and unlock achievements as you explore and dismantle these fishing boats. Each shipwreck brings new goals and rewards for you.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826010?t=1752238964","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/14a550599b24bedef50ab1a6f165ea30d439e4ae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752238964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/9189266dc0570cde0659d5a3811d5feae0a97a44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752238964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826010/9189266dc0570cde0659d5a3811d5feae0a97a44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752238964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Four Unique Fishing Boats Await</h2>Step aboard four distinctive fishing vessels: Arc, Sea Hunter, Mono-brew, and Richi-Kali. Each boat offers its own structure, secrets, and opportunities to be discovered.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn